{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15204490","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15204490","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1520449001:0":{"text":"魔法师大人，您刚刚说……要为营地提供食物？这是，这是真的吗？","source_cn":"魔法师大人，您刚刚说……要为营地提供食物？这是，这是真的吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x401C53A217EC822E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"魔法师大人，您刚刚说……要为营地提供食物？这是，这是真的吗？","female":"魔法师大人，您刚刚说……要为营地提供食物？这是，这是真的吗？","variant_male_record_index":"186295","variant_female_record_index":"186296","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520449002:0":{"text":"先说好，可不是什么珍馐美食。","source_cn":"先说好，可不是什么珍馐美食。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE827AC17BF2C8A79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520449003:0":{"text":"只有针蝗肉，以后魔法师协会将定期准备一些可食用的虫肉分给你们。","source_cn":"只有针蝗肉，以后魔法师协会将定期准备一些可食用的虫肉分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF17DE2F5355E15A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520449004:0":{"text":"这就足够了，我们不敢奢求太多——谢谢您，谢谢您！","source_cn":"这就足够了，我们不敢奢求太多——谢谢您，谢谢您！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13D7DF188D9C0E17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520449005:1":{"text":"妈妈，意思是说，以后我们还能吃到肉吗……？","source_cn":"妈妈，意思是说，以后我们还能吃到肉吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0926A0CA8F235A0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520449006:0":{"text":"是的，孩子，是的……我们不用再挨饿了，多亏了这些好心的魔法师大人……","source_cn":"是的，孩子，是的……我们不用再挨饿了，多亏了这些好心的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8692D96D78837C45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520449007:1":{"text":"先别急着高兴，话还没说完呢。","source_cn":"先别急着高兴，话还没说完呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8AFC4317F2CBA72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520449008:0":{"text":"魔法师协会可以为你们提供食物，但前提是——","source_cn":"魔法师协会可以为你们提供食物，但前提是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD21FC86D408B0F73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520449009:0":{"text":"你们必须接受我的魔法追踪，并保证不会把这件事泄露出去。","source_cn":"你们必须接受我的魔法追踪，并保证不会把这件事泄露出去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C501E325D90A66F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1520449010:0":{"text":"……摩根？","source_cn":"……摩根？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96A970061099B0F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1